OL,3,GNEWSACarnival wants community views to
OL,4,Aprotect its future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chief executive of a city's carnival
OL,7,Fsays he wants to create a "strong
OL,8,Fbaseline" for the annual event so it
OL,9,Fcan be enjoyed for future generations.
OL,11,FA full-scale St Pauls Carnival in
OL,12,FBristol, which usually attracts about
OL,13,F150,000 people, has not taken place
OL,14,Fsince July 2023, although many people
OL,15,Fattended community workshops and
OL,16,Funofficial celebrations this year.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
