OL,3,GNEWSACarnival wants community views to
OL,4,Aprotect its future
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the event edges closer to its 60th
OL,7,Fanniversary in 2028, Ricardo Sharry,
OL,8,Fchief executive of the community
OL,9,Finterest company (CIC) behind the
OL,10,Fevent, said he wanted
OL,11,Fcross-generational community input to
OL,12,Fdrive the organisation forward.
OL,14,FA survey is taking place until 3
OL,15,FOctober asking carnival attendees to
OL,16,Fsuggest how it could be improved.
